Cell["\<\
All pairs of generators whose centralizer has order 52, contain Z in both \
elements. Having Z seems a requirement in all cases.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.961083699300667*^9, 
  3.961083736143785*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f29e6ac0-3ad5-de4a-a050-\
